# nr-exthost-pdf-cff-type1 wire fragment

Nothing to apply. No Cargo, workspace, protocol or compose_flip change: mixdog-pdf is already a workspace member, the
readers use only crates it already depends on (tracing), and fontfile/mod.rs already declares `cff` and `type1`.

Notice: the crate's own NOTICE (native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/NOTICE, written by nr-exthost-pdf-syntax) already
credits the Foxit standard fonts of pdfjs-dist with LICENSE_FOXIT; the licence text is carried unchanged in
`native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/src/fontfile/stdfonts/LICENSE_FOXIT`. No NOTICE.md edit is needed.

Packaging: the two .pfb files are include_bytes! data of the crate; nothing to copy at packaging time.
